tate":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[{"login":"BeyondzychenProton","id":292296002,"node_id":"U_kgDOEWwVQg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/292296002?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeyondzychenProton","html_url":"https://github.com/BeyondzychenProton","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeyondzychenProton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeyondzychenProton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeyondzychenProton/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeyondzychenProton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeyondzychenProton/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeyondzychenProton/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeyondzychenProton/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeyondzychenProton/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeyondzychenProton/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-10-25T12:50:50Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T14:36:58Z","closed_at":"2026-10-25T14:36:58Z","assignee":{"login":"BeyondzychenProton","id":292296002,"node_id":"U_kgDOEWwVQg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/292296002?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeyondzychenProton","html_url":"https://github.com/BeyondzychenProton","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeyondzychenProton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeyondzychenProton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeyondzychenProton/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeyondzychenProton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeyondzychenProton/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeyondzychenProton/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeyondzychenProton/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeyondzychenProton/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeyondzychenProton/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":3,"total_blocking":3},"body":"<!-- agentscope-stage01-ticket-20261025-01 -->\n\n## Parent\n\n来源：[已确认实施路线 #23](https://github.com/BeyondzychenProton/agentscope-brain/issues/23#issuecomment-6396363970)，仅承接阶段 0。设计地图：[正式 Web #14](https://github.com/BeyondzychenProton/agentscope-brain/issues/14)、[数据库 #1](https://github.com/BeyondzychenProton/agentscope-brain/issues/1)。\n\n本工单是用户已确认粒度与依赖的实施切片；沿用 GLOSSARY.md 和既定设计，不重新决策，不修改来源议题或原生父子关系。\n\n## What to build\n\n在固定的实际后端 classpath 中，完成可复现构建与两个 Schema 校验入口的兼容准入，为后续应用和 SDK 探针提供同一份已验证依赖基线。\n\n## Specification references\n\n- [实施路线 §5 工作与退出条件 1—2、§13 固定依赖验证责任](https://github.com/BeyondzychenProton/agentscope-brain/issues/23#issuecomment-6396363970)\n- [后端主规格 §3 工程与初始依赖，以及 §16 的固定依赖一行](https://github.com/BeyondzychenProton/agentscope-brain/issues/22#issuecomment-6394913987)\n\n仅链接既有完整规格，不复制全文；以下验收与范围说明限定本条覆盖的段落和场景。\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [x] 采用既定 Java／Boot／AgentScope 及配套初始基线，核验目标 OS 的构建制品与校验值；保存 actual effective POM、完整 dependency tree、编译和目标字节码证据，SDK 模块统一锁定版本。\n- [x] 实际启动隔离装配，记录 Boot／MyBatis-Plus 自动配置结果，并核对双 Jackson、Reactor／Kotlin、MinIO 与 SDK 的真实传递组合；静态依赖声明不能代替此证据。\n- [x] 同一真实 classpath 中 networknt 3.0.6 同时通过 SDK 默认 ToolValidator 原生入口（包括既定 String／InputFormat 接缝）和应用 draft-07 校验。\n- [x] 应用侧探针覆盖 format 断言、禁止外部／本地任意引用、封闭引用策略及字段错误路径；非法样本按预期拒绝，不通过关闭校验获得成功。\n- [x] 任一交点失败，明确记录不兼容与关联阻塞；不自行 shade、fork、关闭校验或更换已定技术路线。\n\n## Scope boundaries\n\n只覆盖依赖求解、编译／目标字节码、自动配置与校验入口探针。不创建业务链路、正式业务库或前端；不做 pending、实际模型、MCP、MinIO 网络接入。不将引用章节中的其他运行验证收入本工单。\n\n## Execution constraints\n\n无需等待正式业务库。所需目标 JDK／构建制品缺失只阻断对应构建证据，不猜测已安装或已通过。\n\n开发环境内的隔离 Schema／可重建副本不是新增正式环境。资源缺失只阻断对应能力与真实验收；发布工单不代表已实施、执行 DDL／初始化、接入外部服务、提交／推送或部署，实际执行沿用既定授权边界。\n\n## Blocked by\n\n无工单前置；实施输入与目标数据集隔离要求仍须满足。\n\n## Evidence and completion\n\n每个用例记录阶段／用例编号、引用契约、环境与构建／依赖／结构／发布指纹、前置数据、复现步骤、预期与实测、持久事实／关联标识、适用的调用计数、证据位置及结论／缺口。按本条范围分别记录开发完成、隔离验证、真实验收与阻塞项；阶段通过不能用工单关闭数量或旧 29 表 SQL 结果代替。不得记录密码、API Key、确认 token／密文或完整秘密配置。\n\n## Implementation result (2026-10-25)\n\n本条范围内已完成，见[最终结论与 JDK 制品补证](https://github.com/BeyondzychenProton/agentscope-brain/issues/24#issuecomment-6398934675)。用户确认本次使用现有 JDK 17；实际 Windows Oracle JDK 17.0.9 官方 ZIP 摘要与本机 416 文件逐项一致，Temurin 部署候选缺失不再构成本条阻塞。既定 Java 17／Boot／AgentScope 路线保持。\n\n14 项测试通过、独立 clean 构建一致、两轴审查无剩余问题。本条完成不代表阶段 0 整体或上线验收通过，不自动推进其他工单；源码仍未提交／推送，未部署。\n","closed_by":{"login":"BeyondzychenProton","id":292296002,"node_id":"U_kgDOEWwVQg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/292296002?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeyondzychenProton","html_url":"https://github.com/BeyondzychenProton","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeyondzychenProton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeyondzychenProton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeyondzychenProton/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeyondzychenProton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeyondzychenProton/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeyondzychenProton/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeyondzychenProton/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeyondzychenProton/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeyondzychenProton/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeyondzychenProton/agentscope-brain/issues/24/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hoo